  },
  {
    "id": 90002,
    "index": 1,
    "start": 8.54,
    "end": 11.41,
    "english": "This is 6 Minute English from BBC Learning English.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>This</span> <span>is</span> <span>6</span> <span>Minute</span> <span>English</span> <span>from</span> <span>BBC</span> <span>Learning</span> <span>English.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90003,
    "index": 2,
    "start": 11.41,
    "end": 12.311,
    "english": "I’m Neil.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>I’m</span> <span>Neil.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90004,
    "index": 3,
    "start": 12.311,
    "end": 13.5,
    "english": "And I’m Beth.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>And</span> <span>I’m</span> <span>Beth.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90005,
    "index": 4,
    "start": 13.5,
    "end": 17.72,
    "english": "When I was a boy, I wanted to be a fireman when I grew up.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>When</span> <span>I</span> <span>was</span> <span>a</span> <span>boy,</span> <span>I</span> <span>wanted</span> <span>to</span> <span>be</span> <span>a</span> <span>fireman</span> <span>when</span> <span>I</span> <span>grew</span> <span>up.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90006,
    "index": 5,
    "start": 17.72,
    "end": 18.72,
    "english": "How about you, Beth?",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>How</span> <span>about</span> <span>you,</span> <span>Beth?</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90007,
    "index": 6,
    "start": 18.72,
    "end": 20.72,
    "english": "Did you have any childhood dreams?",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>Did</span> <span>you</span> <span>have</span> <span>any</span> <span>childhood</span> <span>dreams?</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90008,
    "index": 7,
    "start": 20.72,
    "end": 24.47,
    "english": "I wanted to be an astronaut and fly to the Moon…",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>I</span> <span>wanted</span> <span>to</span> <span>be</span> <span>an</span> <span>astronaut</span> <span>and</span> <span>fly</span> <span>to</span> <span>the</span> <span>Moon…</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90009,
    "index": 8,
    "start": 24.47,
    "end": 28.92,
    "english": "When we’re young most of us have big dreams and plans for the future.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>When</span> <span>we’re</span> <span>young</span> <span>most</span> <span>of</span> <span>us</span> <span>have</span> <span>big</span> <span>dreams</span> <span>and</span> <span>plans</span> <span>for</span> <span>the</span> <span>future.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90010,
    "index": 9,
    "start": 28.92,
    "end": 36.979,
    "english": "Unfortunately, as we grow up these childhood dreams often get lost in the adult world of jobs, money,",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>Unfortunately,</span> <span>as</span> <span>we</span> <span>grow</span> <span>up</span> <span>these</span> <span>childhood</span> <span>dreams</span> <span>often</span> <span>get</span> <span>lost</span> <span>in</span> <span>the</span> <span>adult</span> <span>world</span> <span>of</span> <span>jobs,</span> <span>money,</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90011,
    "index": 10,
    "start": 36.979,
    "end": 38.519,
    "english": "families and careers.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>families</span> <span>and</span> <span>careers.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90012,
    "index": 11,
    "start": 38.519,
    "end": 39.989,
    "english": "But not for everyone…",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>But</span> <span>not</span> <span>for</span> <span>everyone…</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90013,
    "index": 12,
    "start": 39.989,
    "end": 48.059,
    "english": "Daisy, from New Zealand, and, Herman, from Argentina are two people who decided to follow their childhood dreams.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>Daisy,</span> <span>from</span> <span>New</span> <span>Zealand,</span> <span>and,</span> <span>Herman,</span> <span>from</span> <span>Argentina</span> <span>are</span> <span>two</span> <span>people</span> <span>who</span> <span>decided</span> <span>to</span> <span>follow</span> <span>their</span> <span>childhood</span> <span>dreams.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90014,
    "index": 13,
    "start": 48.059,
    "end": 56.85,
    "english": "They wanted the world to become a utopia – a perfect, ideal society where everyone is happy and gets along with each other.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>They</span> <span>wanted</span> <span>the</span> <span>world</span> <span>to</span> <span>become</span> <span>a</span> <span>utopia</span> <span>–</span> <span>a</span> <span>perfect,</span> <span>ideal</span> <span>society</span> <span>where</span> <span>everyone</span> <span>is</span> <span>happy</span> <span>and</span> <span>gets</span> <span>along</span> <span>with</span> <span>each</span> <span>other.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90015,
    "index": 14,
    "start": 56.85,
    "end": 64.629,
    "english": "In this programme, we’ll be hearing how Daisy and Herman made their dreams come true – not by changing the world,",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>In</span> <span>this</span> <span>programme,</span> <span>we’ll</span> <span>be</span> <span>hearing</span> <span>how</span> <span>Daisy</span> <span>and</span> <span>Herman</span> <span>made</span> <span>their</span> <span>dreams</span> <span>come</span> <span>true</span> <span>–</span> <span>not</span> <span>by</span> <span>changing</span> <span>the</span> <span>world,</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90016,
    "index": 15,
    "start": 64.629,
    "end": 66.25,
    "english": "but by changing themselves.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>but</span> <span>by</span> <span>changing</span> <span>themselves.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90017,
    "index": 16,
    "start": 66.25,
    "end": 70.43,
    "english": "And, as usual, we’ll be learning some new vocabulary too.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>And,</span> <span>as</span> <span>usual,</span> <span>we’ll</span> <span>be</span> <span>learning</span> <span>some</span> <span>new</span> <span>vocabulary</span> <span>too.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90018,
    "index": 17,
    "start": 70.43,
    "end": 74.42,
    "english": "But before that I have a question for you, Beth.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>But</span> <span>before</span> <span>that</span> <span>I</span> <span>have</span> <span>a</span> <span>question</span> <span>for</span> <span>you,</span> <span>Beth.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90019,
    "index": 18,
    "start": 74.42,
    "end": 80.32,
    "english": "Following your dreams can be tough, but not following them can leave you regretting all the things you wanted",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>Following</span> <span>your</span> <span>dreams</span> <span>can</span> <span>be</span> <span>tough,</span> <span>but</span> <span>not</span> <span>following</span> <span>them</span> <span>can</span> <span>leave</span> <span>you</span> <span>regretting</span> <span>all</span> <span>the</span> <span>things</span> <span>you</span> <span>wanted</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90020,
    "index": 19,
    "start": 80.32,
    "end": 82.28,
    "english": "to do but didn’t.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>to</span> <span>do</span> <span>but</span> <span>didn’t.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90021,
    "index": 20,
    "start": 82.28,
    "end": 88.731,
    "english": "In 2012, Australian nurse, Bronnie Ware, wrote her bestselling book, The Top Five Regrets of the Dying, after",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>In</span> <span>2012,</span> <span>Australian</span> <span>nurse,</span> <span>Bronnie</span> <span>Ware,</span> <span>wrote</span> <span>her</span> <span>bestselling</span> <span>book,</span> <span>The</span> <span>Top</span> <span>Five</span> <span>Regrets</span> <span>of</span> <span>the</span> <span>Dying,</span> <span>after</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90022,
    "index": 21,
    "start": 88.731,
    "end": 92.7,
    "english": "interviewing terminally ill patients about their life regrets.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>interviewing</span> <span>terminally</span> <span>ill</span> <span>patients</span> <span>about</span> <span>their</span> <span>life</span> <span>regrets.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90023,
    "index": 22,
    "start": 92.7,
    "end": 96.56,
    "english": "So, what do you think their top regret was?",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>So,</span> <span>what</span> <span>do</span> <span>you</span> <span>think</span> <span>their</span> <span>top</span> <span>regret</span> <span>was?</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90024,
    "index": 23,
    "start": 96.56,
    "end": 99.95,
    "english": "Was it: a) I wish I hadn’t worked so hard?",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>Was</span> <span>it:</span> <span>a)</span> <span>I</span> <span>wish</span> <span>I</span> <span>hadn’t</span> <span>worked</span> <span>so</span> <span>hard?</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90025,
    "index": 24,
    "start": 99.95,
    "end": 102.65,
    "english": "b) I wish I had followed my dreams?",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>b)</span> <span>I</span> <span>wish</span> <span>I</span> <span>had</span> <span>followed</span> <span>my</span> <span>dreams?</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90026,
    "index": 25,
    "start": 102.65,
    "end": 105.14,
    "english": "or c) I wish I’d made more money?",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>or</span> <span>c)</span> <span>I</span> <span>wish</span> <span>I’d</span> <span>made</span> <span>more</span> <span>money?</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90027,
    "index": 26,
    "start": 105.14,
    "end": 109.58,
    "english": "Well, I’ll guess it’s b) they wish they had followed their dreams.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>Well,</span> <span>I’ll</span> <span>guess</span> <span>it’s</span> <span>b)</span> <span>they</span> <span>wish</span> <span>they</span> <span>had</span> <span>followed</span> <span>their</span> <span>dreams.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90028,
    "index": 27,
    "start": 109.58,
    "end": 110.58,
    "english": "OK, Beth.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>OK,</span> <span>Beth.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90029,
    "index": 28,
    "start": 110.58,
    "end": 113.75,
    "english": "I’ll reveal the correct answer at the end of the programme.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>I’ll</span> <span>reveal</span> <span>the</span> <span>correct</span> <span>answer</span> <span>at</span> <span>the</span> <span>end</span> <span>of</span> <span>the</span> <span>programme.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90030,
    "index": 29,
    "start": 113.75,
    "end": 121.409,
    "english": "The first dreamer we’re going to meet lives in Riverside, a peace-loving community in New Zealand where everyone shares",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>The</span> <span>first</span> <span>dreamer</span> <span>we’re</span> <span>going</span> <span>to</span> <span>meet</span> <span>lives</span> <span>in</span> <span>Riverside,</span> <span>a</span> <span>peace-loving</span> <span>community</span> <span>in</span> <span>New</span> <span>Zealand</span> <span>where</span> <span>everyone</span> <span>shares</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90031,
    "index": 30,
    "start": 121.409,
    "end": 122.79,
    "english": "everything.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>everything.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90032,
    "index": 31,
    "start": 122.79,
    "end": 130.11,
    "english": "Riverside members work for the community’s businesses, including a farm, a hotel and a café.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>Riverside</span> <span>members</span> <span>work</span> <span>for</span> <span>the</span> <span>community’s</span> <span>businesses,</span> <span>including</span> <span>a</span> <span>farm,</span> <span>a</span> <span>hotel</span> <span>and</span> <span>a</span> <span>café.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90033,
    "index": 32,
    "start": 130.11,
    "end": 134.78,
    "english": "All the money they earn is collected and shared between everyone equally.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>All</span> <span>the</span> <span>money</span> <span>they</span> <span>earn</span> <span>is</span> <span>collected</span> <span>and</span> <span>shared</span> <span>between</span> <span>everyone</span> <span>equally.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90034,
    "index": 33,
    "start": 134.78,
    "end": 140.18,
    "english": "Daisy, who was born in East Germany, joined Riverside in 2004.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>Daisy,</span> <span>who</span> <span>was</span> <span>born</span> <span>in</span> <span>East</span> <span>Germany,</span> <span>joined</span> <span>Riverside</span> <span>in</span> <span>2004.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90035,
    "index": 34,
    "start": 140.18,
    "end": 146.56,
    "english": "Here she explains her belief in sharing to BBC World Service programme, The Documentary.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>Here</span> <span>she</span> <span>explains</span> <span>her</span> <span>belief</span> <span>in</span> <span>sharing</span> <span>to</span> <span>BBC</span> <span>World</span> <span>Service</span> <span>programme,</span> <span>The</span> <span>Documentary.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90036,
    "index": 35,
    "start": 146.56,
    "end": 153.7,
    "english": "What I think I always believed in is that the sharing of resources can provide a group of people with quite a great",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>What</span> <span>I</span> <span>think</span> <span>I</span> <span>always</span> <span>believed</span> <span>in</span> <span>is</span> <span>that</span> <span>the</span> <span>sharing</span> <span>of</span> <span>resources</span> <span>can</span> <span>provide</span> <span>a</span> <span>group</span> <span>of</span> <span>people</span> <span>with</span> <span>quite</span> <span>a</span> <span>great</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90037,
    "index": 36,
    "start": 153.7,
    "end": 159.159,
    "english": "advantage, but it doesn’t matter how many hours you work or what work you do, everyone is getting the",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>advantage,</span> <span>but</span> <span>it</span> <span>doesn’t</span> <span>matter</span> <span>how</span> <span>many</span> <span>hours</span> <span>you</span> <span>work</span> <span>or</span> <span>what</span> <span>work</span> <span>you</span> <span>do,</span> <span>everyone</span> <span>is</span> <span>getting</span> <span>the</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90038,
    "index": 37,
    "start": 159.159,
    "end": 160.819,
    "english": "same amount.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>same</span> <span>amount.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90039,
    "index": 38,
    "start": 160.819,
    "end": 168.04,
    "english": "And that is something that many people outside of Riverside struggle with, and where we’re often getting this ‘communism’",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>And</span> <span>that</span> <span>is</span> <span>something</span> <span>that</span> <span>many</span> <span>people</span> <span>outside</span> <span>of</span> <span>Riverside</span> <span>struggle</span> <span>with,</span> <span>and</span> <span>where</span> <span>we’re</span> <span>often</span> <span>getting</span> <span>this</span> <span>‘communism’</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90040,
    "index": 39,
    "start": 168.04,
    "end": 171.769,
    "english": "label attached to us, because it’s so…",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>label</span> <span>attached</span> <span>to</span> <span>us,</span> <span>because</span> <span>it’s</span> <span>so…</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90041,
    "index": 40,
    "start": 171.769,
    "end": 174.849,
    "english": "it seems so outlandish for people.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>it</span> <span>seems</span> <span>so</span> <span>outlandish</span> <span>for</span> <span>people.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90042,
    "index": 41,
    "start": 174.849,
    "end": 177.76,
    "english": "Riverside isn’t a communist community.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>Riverside</span> <span>isn’t</span> <span>a</span> <span>communist</span> <span>community.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90043,
    "index": 42,
    "start": 177.76,
    "end": 182.2,
    "english": "In fact, people with many different political views live there.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>In</span> <span>fact,</span> <span>people</span> <span>with</span> <span>many</span> <span>different</span> <span>political</span> <span>views</span> <span>live</span> <span>there.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90044,
    "index": 43,
    "start": 182.2,
    "end": 188.029,
    "english": "But Daisy says that local people struggle with the idea that everything is shared.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>But</span> <span>Daisy</span> <span>says</span> <span>that</span> <span>local</span> <span>people</span> <span>struggle</span> <span>with</span> <span>the</span> <span>idea</span> <span>that</span> <span>everything</span> <span>is</span> <span>shared.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90045,
    "index": 44,
    "start": 188.029,
    "end": 193.499,
    "english": "If you struggle with an idea, you find it difficult to accept or think about it.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>If</span> <span>you</span> <span>struggle</span> <span>with</span> <span>an</span> <span>idea,</span> <span>you</span> <span>find</span> <span>it</span> <span>difficult</span> <span>to</span> <span>accept</span> <span>or</span> <span>think</span> <span>about</span> <span>it.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90046,
    "index": 45,
    "start": 193.499,
    "end": 200.299,
    "english": "Daisy also says some local people call Riverside outlandish – strange and unusual.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>Daisy</span> <span>also</span> <span>says</span> <span>some</span> <span>local</span> <span>people</span> <span>call</span> <span>Riverside</span> <span>outlandish</span> <span>–</span> <span>strange</span> <span>and</span> <span>unusual.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90047,
    "index": 46,
    "start": 200.299,
    "end": 204.73,
    "english": "Our second group of dreamers are a family - the Zapps.",
    "chinese": "",
    "ipa": "",
    "english_html": "<span>Our</span> <span>second</span> <span>group</span> <span>of</span> <span>dreamers</span> <span>are</span> <span>a</span> <span>family</span> <span>-</span> <span>the</span> <span>Zapps.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 90048,
    "index": 47,
    "start": 204.73,
    "end": 213.529,
    "english": "In 2000, childhood sweethearts, Herman and Candelaria Zapp, bought a vintage car and set off from Argentina to travel around",
